---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const gate = "https://lin.ee/9ciZvbA?utm_source=website&utm_medium=cta&utm_campaign=process-deliverable";
---

<BaseLayout title="合作流程與申請時程｜TBD Studio" description="TBD Studio 合作流程與申請時程：從策略諮詢、素材盤點到備審重構與面試訓練的六階段 SOP，以及個人申請、研究所推甄、特殊選才各管道的關鍵節點時程。" bodyClass="sub-page process-page">
<section class="hero">
  <span class="kicker">合作流程與申請時程</span>
  <h1>知道該做什麼、知道什麼時候做，準備才不會亂。</h1>
  <p class="lead">申請時程說明各升學管道的關鍵節點；合作流程說明 TBD 在這些節點協助你做什麼、你需要準備什麼。</p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="button secondary" href="/pages/services.html">了解服務內容</a>
    <a class="button" href="https://lin.ee/9ciZvbA?utm_source=website&utm_medium=cta&utm_campaign=process" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ga-event="click_line_process">預約策略諮詢</a>
  </div>
</section>

<main>

  <!-- ── 申請時程（時序圖）── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="services-chapter-header">
      <span class="kicker">01 申請時程</span>
      <h2>各升學管道的關鍵節點</h2>
      <p class="services-chapter-desc">不同管道的準備節奏不一樣。找到你的路線，確認目前應該在哪個階段。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="track-tabs" style="margin-top: 24px;">
      <nav class="track-tab-nav" role="tablist">
        <button class="track-tab active" data-track="personal" role="tab" aria-selected="true">大學個人申請</button>
        <button class="track-tab" data-track="grad" role="tab" aria-selected="false">研究所推甄</button>
        <button class="track-tab" data-track="special" role="tab" aria-selected="false">特殊選才</button>
      </nav>

      <!-- 大學個人申請 -->
      <div class="track-panel active" id="track-personal" role="tabpanel">
        <p class="scroll-hint">→ 時程軸可往右滑，看完整節點（含備審上傳與二階面試）</p>
        <div class="track-timeline">
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高二下 ～ 高三上</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>累積與盤點期</h3>
              <p>學習歷程整理、科系探索、多元表現盤點。</p>
              <div class="tbd-tip">← TBD 最佳切入時機</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 1 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>學測前後</h3>
              <p>申請方向初判、落點預估。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 2 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>學測成績公布</h3>
              <p>選校策略確認、申請校系定案。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 3 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>一階篩選</h3>
              <p>針對通過校系客製備審。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 4 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>備審上傳期</h3>
              <p>自傳、申請動機、讀書計畫、學習歷程自述。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 5 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>二階面試</h3>
              <p>模擬面試、教授追問、臨場表達。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高三 6 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>志願序與放榜</h3>
              <p>志願排序、備取判斷。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 研究所推甄 -->
      <div class="track-panel" id="track-grad" role="tabpanel">
        <p class="scroll-hint">→ 時程軸可往右滑，看完整節點</p>
        <div class="track-timeline">
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">大三下 ～ 暑假</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>前置準備</h3>
              <p>履歷、自傳、研究方向確認、教授名單。</p>
              <div class="tbd-tip">← TBD 最佳切入時機</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">7 ～ 8 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>材料初稿</h3>
              <p>研究計畫、讀書計畫、專題整理。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">9 ～ 10 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>報名期</h3>
              <p>書審資料定稿、教授聯絡。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">10 ～ 11 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>面試期</h3>
              <p>模擬面試、研究計畫答辯。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">11 ～ 12 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>放榜期</h3>
              <p>備取策略、後續聯繫。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 特殊選才 -->
      <div class="track-panel" id="track-special" role="tabpanel">
        <p class="scroll-hint">→ 時程軸可往右滑，看完整節點</p>
        <div class="track-timeline">
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">高二 ～ 高三上</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>經歷累積</h3>
              <p>競賽、專題、作品、證明資料。</p>
              <div class="tbd-tip">← TBD 最佳切入時機</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">9 ～ 10 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>簡章公告</h3>
              <p>校系篩選、資格確認。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">10 ～ 11 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>書審報名</h3>
              <p>自傳、成果集、申請動機。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">11 ～ 12 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card milestone-card--highlight">
              <h3>面試／甄試</h3>
              <p>作品答辯、特殊經歷說明。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="track-milestone">
            <div class="milestone-time">12 ～ 1 月</div>
            <div class="milestone-card">
              <h3>放榜</h3>
              <p>後續升學規劃。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── 合作流程（泳道圖）── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="services-chapter-header">
      <span class="kicker">02 合作 SOP</span>
      <h2>從初談到送件，TBD 在每個環節做什麼</h2>
      <p class="services-chapter-desc">每個階段都有明確的學生行動與 TBD 交付物，讓準備有節點、有成果。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="swimlane" style="margin-top: 24px;">
      <div class="swimlane-header">
        <div class="lane-label">學生</div>
        <div class="lane-label lane-label--tbd">TBD Studio</div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 1</div>
          <h3>說明現況</h3>
          <p>說明年級、升學管道、目標校系，描述目前最大卡點。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">策略諮詢</div>
          <h3>評估與診斷</h3>
          <p>60 分鐘初談，輸出申請策略診斷報告（可追蹤、可帶走）。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：申請策略診斷報告</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 2</div>
          <h3>提供原始資料</h3>
          <p>提供成績單、活動清單、作品、競賽紀錄等原始素材。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">素材盤點</div>
          <h3>系統整理</h3>
          <p>建立經歷素材盤點表，標記申請價值與可延伸方向。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：經歷素材盤點表</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 3</div>
          <h3>參與共創討論</h3>
          <p>與 TBD 共同確認申請主線、敘事角度與校系定位。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">主軸設計</div>
          <h3>敘事定位圖</h3>
          <p>建立個人申請主線，確立能力主軸與校系連結邏輯。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：敘事定位文件</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 4</div>
          <h3>提供草稿與回饋</h3>
          <p>提交自傳草稿，說明方向確認或修改需求。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">文件製作</div>
          <h3>多版本協作</h3>
          <p>自傳、申請動機、讀書計畫多版本管理，確保邏輯一致性。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：多版本文件紀錄</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 5</div>
          <h3>模擬面試練習</h3>
          <p>根據客製題庫反覆練習，接受 TBD 追問與結構調整。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">面試訓練</div>
          <h3>題庫與回饋報告</h3>
          <p>設計校系專屬題庫，每次模擬附結構化回饋報告。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：面試題庫＋模擬回饋報告</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="swim-row swim-row--last">
        <div class="swim-cell">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">Phase 6</div>
          <h3>確認送件材料</h3>
          <p>確認所有文件格式與內容，準備上傳或遞送。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="swim-cell swim-cell--tbd">
          <div class="swim-phase-tag">收尾確認</div>
          <h3>最終風險掃描</h3>
          <p>內容一致性確認、面試風險提醒、志願序策略建議。</p>
          <div class="swim-deliverable">交付物：送件檢查清單</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="note" style="margin-top: 16px;">
      各 Phase 的實際順序與深度依學生狀況調整——有些學生從 Phase 3 切入，有些從 Phase 5 開始。初談後 TBD 會說明最適合的切入點。
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── 交付物範例（去識別化）── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="services-chapter-header">
      <span class="kicker">03 交付物範例</span>
      <h2>這六份交付物，實際長什麼樣</h2>
      <p class="services-chapter-desc">以下為去識別化範例——姓名、聯絡方式、金額與可識別細節皆已移除，內容經改寫，不對應任何特定學生。有想深入了解的階段，歡迎加 LINE 聊聊。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="deliv-grid">
      <!-- Phase 1 -->
      <article class="deliv-card deliv-card--wide">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 1</div><h3>申請策略診斷報告</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">已去識別化</span>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-excerpt">
          <p><b>現況診斷：</b>跨校社團總召，具大型活動的專案管理與預算控管實戰；弱項是缺乏直接的資訊技術背景。</p>
          <p><b>策略方向：</b>不與資工正面拚硬技術，改對位「商業分析／系統分析邏輯」，把社團經歷結構化成資管敘事。</p>
          <p><b>關鍵問答：</b>教授若問「為何不讀資工」→ 強調管理溝通與邏輯建構的軟實力，正是商管型資管系最看重的切入點。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <span class="deliv-tag">個人申請 · 目標資管系</span>
          <a class="deliv-gate" href={gate} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-event="click_consultation_cta">💬 加 LINE 進一步了解</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 2 -->
      <article class="deliv-card">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 2</div><h3>經歷素材盤點表</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">已去識別化</span>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-mini-wrap">
          <table class="deliv-mini">
            <thead><tr><th>經歷素材</th><th>對應能力</th><th>關聯度</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td><b>跨校社團總召</b></td><td>專案管理／成本效益分析</td><td><span class="deliv-rel hi">極高</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>自然科探究</b></td><td>定量分析與建模邏輯</td><td><span class="deliv-rel hi">高</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>班級情緒支持專題</b></td><td>需求分析／使用者行為</td><td><span class="deliv-rel hi">高</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>跨校活動流程設計</b></td><td>分支決策／系統流程</td><td><span class="deliv-rel mid">中→高</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <a class="deliv-gate" href={gate} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-event="click_consultation_cta">💬 加 LINE 進一步了解</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 3 -->
      <article class="deliv-card">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 3</div><h3>敘事定位文件</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">已去識別化</span>
        </div>
        <p class="deliv-thesis">「從優化組織的報帳與資訊流程開始，逐步理解資訊系統如何改善運作；再透過研究看見數據如何支撐決策；最後把能力延伸到數位醫療與包容性設計。」</p>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <span class="deliv-tag">組織流程再造</span>
          <span class="deliv-tag">數據驅動決策</span>
          <span class="deliv-tag">社會設計與包容</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 4 -->
      <article class="deliv-card">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 4</div><h3>多版本文件紀錄</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">已去識別化</span>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-changelog">
          <div class="deliv-cl"><div class="v">v1 → v2</div><div class="c">開頭家庭背景過長 → <b>濃縮為 2–3 句</b>，篇幅移到實務經驗。</div></div>
          <div class="deliv-cl"><div class="v">v2 → v3</div><div class="c">社團故事重複 → <b>新增接案案例</b>（定價與成本控管）。</div></div>
          <div class="deliv-cl"><div class="v">v3 → v4</div><div class="c">計畫偏個人索取 → <b>加入校園貢獻與社會責任視角</b>。</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <span class="deliv-tag">版本可回溯</span>
          <a class="deliv-gate" href={gate} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-event="click_consultation_cta">💬 加 LINE 進一步了解</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 5 -->
      <article class="deliv-card">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 5</div><h3>面試題庫 ＋ 模擬回饋</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">範例題</span>
        </div>
        <p class="deliv-thesis">「你說做過活動預算控管——若預算臨時被砍三成，你會先動哪一項、為什麼？」</p>
        <div class="deliv-fb">
          <div class="deliv-fb-row"><span class="deliv-st ok">到位</span>回答結構清楚（先講原則，再舉例）</div>
          <div class="deliv-fb-row"><span class="deliv-st adj">再補強</span>證據具體度：加上實際數字更有說服力</div>
          <div class="deliv-fb-row"><span class="deliv-st adj">再補強</span>收回能力主線，別只複述經歷</div>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <a class="deliv-gate" href={gate} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-event="click_consultation_cta">💬 加 LINE 進一步了解</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Phase 6 -->
      <article class="deliv-card">
        <div class="deliv-head">
          <div><div class="deliv-phase">PHASE 6</div><h3>送件檢查清單</h3></div>
          <span class="deliv-deid">已去識別化</span>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-checks">
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>各校簡章與繳交項目逐校核對</div>
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>檔案格式、頁數上限、命名規則</div>
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>各校客製版本對應正確系所</div>
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>上傳期限與離線備份</div>
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>圖說、頁碼與內文一致</div>
          <div class="deliv-chk"><span class="box">✓</span>最終錯字與排版複檢</div>
        </div>
        <div class="deliv-chips">
          <a class="deliv-gate" href={gate} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-event="click_consultation_cta">💬 加 LINE 進一步了解</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- 方法示範：Before → After -->
    <div class="services-chapter-header" style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <span class="kicker">方法示範</span>
      <h2>不是把經歷寫得漂亮，而是整理出結構與證據</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="deliv-ba" style="margin-top: 20px;">
